WEBVTT

1
00:59:03.042 --> 00:59:10.042
Hallelujah, hallelujah, praise His name, hallelujah.

2
00:59:10.042 --> 00:59:25.042
Church, I want to say that if you think to yourself, may I take this communion,

3
00:59:25.042 --> 00:59:30.042
or you are afraid that you repeat a sin every time, that you keep repeating this,

4
00:59:30.042 --> 00:59:36.042
and that you think to yourself, then I cannot do it now. I understand those thought processes.

5
00:59:36.042 --> 00:59:40.042
I have experienced this cycle for a long time.

6
00:59:40.042 --> 00:59:45.042
That it was difficult for me to come to forgiveness because it goes wrong every time.

7
00:59:45.042 --> 00:59:48.042
But that is why we are also together as a church.

8
00:59:48.042 --> 00:59:54.042
That is why you are together as a church, so that you can help each other to come to holiness. Amen.

9
00:59:54.042 --> 00:59:56.042
Amen.

10
00:59:57.042 --> 01:00:02.042
Shall we give each other a high five, because everyone is super quiet.

11
01:00:02.042 --> 01:00:06.042
And say hello to each other for a moment.

12
01:00:12.042 --> 01:00:14.042
Hallelujah.

13
01:00:14.042 --> 01:00:17.042
Please give each other a blessing.

14
01:00:26.042 --> 01:00:28.042
Yes.

15
01:00:47.042 --> 01:00:49.042
Voila, we are here.

16
01:00:49.042 --> 01:00:52.042
I need to take a small bottle of water.

17
01:00:57.042 --> 01:01:01.042
Robert, now I see that he is your son.

18
01:01:01.042 --> 01:01:04.042
I saw you standing by the door this morning.

19
01:01:04.042 --> 01:01:07.042
And I thought, I know him from somewhere, but I don't really know him.

20
01:01:07.042 --> 01:01:09.042
He is your son.

21
01:01:09.042 --> 01:01:12.042
Handsome son, handsome son. Welcome.

22
01:01:12.042 --> 01:01:14.042
Hallelujah.

23
01:01:17.042 --> 01:01:19.042
Hallelujah, free treasure.

24
01:01:19.042 --> 01:01:23.042
When I have such a sentence, I am very happy.

25
01:01:23.042 --> 01:01:25.042
Hallelujah, free treasure.

26
01:01:25.042 --> 01:01:35.042
When I say that I experience God is cleansing things.

27
01:01:35.042 --> 01:01:38.042
Am I the only one or are there more people with testimonies?

28
01:01:38.042 --> 01:01:43.042
Give me a wave if you feel that you understand what we as a church are going through.

29
01:01:43.042 --> 01:01:45.042
Give a wave.

30
01:01:45.042 --> 01:01:47.042
Alright, alright, fair enough.

31
01:01:47.042 --> 01:01:49.042
I like it.

32
01:01:49.042 --> 01:01:52.042
Testimonies are going to come, I am sure of it.

33
01:01:52.042 --> 01:01:54.042
I think...

34
01:01:54.042 --> 01:01:56.042
There is a little Doan.

35
01:01:56.042 --> 01:01:58.042
Hold me up, Doan.

36
01:02:04.042 --> 01:02:06.042
Beautiful, beautiful.

37
01:02:07.042 --> 01:02:09.042
God is a good God, people.

38
01:02:10.042 --> 01:02:12.042
And He is really at work.

39
01:02:12.042 --> 01:02:15.042
I just don't know how we...

40
01:02:15.042 --> 01:02:18.042
Mom and dad, you can sit down.

41
01:02:19.042 --> 01:02:21.042
High five.

42
01:02:26.042 --> 01:02:31.042
I just don't really know how to explain how God is at work.

43
01:02:31.042 --> 01:02:35.042
But God is really extremely active.

44
01:02:35.042 --> 01:02:38.042
I will repeat this once more.

45
01:02:38.042 --> 01:02:40.042
I have said this before.

46
01:02:40.042 --> 01:02:51.042
Personally, I have never been so enthusiastic and so clear about the time I am in now.

47
01:02:51.042 --> 01:03:01.042
I understand well that if you have experienced a lot, you might say that was a wonderful time in my life and I saw God do amazing work there.

48
01:03:01.042 --> 01:03:05.042
I now say for my life, that is my testimony.

49
01:03:05.042 --> 01:03:15.042
The time we are in now as a church and the shift that God is making and the work I see around me in people.

50
01:03:15.042 --> 01:03:22.042
It is so clear and it is so strong and I honor God for it and I am sure that testimonies will come forth from it.

51
01:03:22.042 --> 01:03:24.042
And...

52
01:03:24.042 --> 01:03:27.042
Can we please give God a round of applause or something?

53
01:03:28.042 --> 01:03:29.042
Thank you.

54
01:03:33.042 --> 01:03:34.042
Thank you.

55
01:03:38.042 --> 01:03:42.042
Paul can sometimes say something very straightforward.

56
01:03:42.042 --> 01:03:44.042
Let's take a look at that.

57
01:03:46.042 --> 01:03:49.042
Do not let your life be ruled by greed for money.

58
01:03:49.042 --> 01:03:50.042
Wow.

59
01:03:51.042 --> 01:03:53.042
Be content with what you have.

60
01:03:54.042 --> 01:03:55.042
Wow, Paul.

61
01:03:56.042 --> 01:03:58.042
Stay away from my flesh.

62
01:03:58.042 --> 01:03:59.042
Don't say that.

63
01:03:59.042 --> 01:04:01.042
I don't want to hear that.

64
01:04:01.042 --> 01:04:06.042
You know, we have become so accustomed in our society to collecting.

65
01:04:06.042 --> 01:04:09.042
Collecting things, collecting money.

66
01:04:09.042 --> 01:04:10.042
Have, have, have.

67
01:04:10.042 --> 01:04:13.042
That is that greed for money, avarice.

68
01:04:13.042 --> 01:04:15.042
Another translation says.

69
01:04:15.042 --> 01:04:18.042
That is drilled into us from a young age.

70
01:04:19.042 --> 01:04:22.042
But that is the thinking of the world.

71
01:04:23.042 --> 01:04:26.042
The thinking of God's kingdom is completely different.

72
01:04:26.042 --> 01:04:32.042
The Bible also says, when you get to know God, there comes a renewal of your mind.

73
01:04:32.042 --> 01:04:36.042
That means, you will think differently.

74
01:04:36.042 --> 01:04:39.042
You will think according to what the Bible says.

75
01:04:39.042 --> 01:04:42.042
And then you will think differently.

76
01:04:42.042 --> 01:04:45.042
For how do we view these finances?

77
01:04:47.042 --> 01:04:51.042
He has said to myself, God has said to myself.

78
01:04:51.042 --> 01:04:55.042
I will never forsake you, I will never leave you.

79
01:04:56.042 --> 01:04:58.042
That is completely different.

80
01:04:59.042 --> 01:05:03.042
In the world you think, I must collect because I am on my own.

81
01:05:03.042 --> 01:05:06.042
And no one else is going to take care of me, you know.

82
01:05:06.042 --> 01:05:10.042
Not the government and not my neighbors, and I have to take care of myself.

83
01:05:10.042 --> 01:05:13.042
But God says, I will take care of you.

84
01:05:13.042 --> 01:05:15.042
I will never leave you alone.

85
01:05:16.042 --> 01:05:22.042
So that we can confidently say, the Lord is my helper.

86
01:05:22.042 --> 01:05:27.042
I have nothing to fear, what can man do to me?

87
01:05:27.042 --> 01:05:30.042
And that is a different way of thinking.

88
01:05:30.042 --> 01:05:38.042
If you simply trust your faith in God, place your trust in Him.

89
01:05:38.042 --> 01:05:43.042
And believe that He takes care of you, then you have nothing to fear.

90
01:05:43.042 --> 01:05:46.042
Then you don't have to be afraid of what comes your way.

91
01:05:46.042 --> 01:05:50.042
And that applies to your finances just as clearly.

92
01:05:51.042 --> 01:05:53.042
It's a different way of thinking.

93
01:05:53.042 --> 01:05:58.042
For when we give to the church, when we give financially,

94
01:05:58.042 --> 01:06:02.042
we don't have to be afraid that we will come up short at the end of the month.

95
01:06:03.042 --> 01:06:10.042
Tim just asked, who notices that there is change happening in your life or cleansing?

96
01:06:10.042 --> 01:06:16.042
I can also ask, how many people have testimonies that when you have given,

97
01:06:16.042 --> 01:06:23.042
financially, that in the same month you see wonders from that.

98
01:06:23.042 --> 01:06:25.042
That God takes care of you.

99
01:06:25.042 --> 01:06:27.042
I also call that winks from God.

100
01:06:27.042 --> 01:06:32.042
You know, that at the right moment you receive a tax refund.

101
01:06:32.042 --> 01:06:36.042
Or that your boss says, you are doing your best, you get a raise.

102
01:06:36.042 --> 01:06:40.042
Such things, just ask around about them during coffee.

103
01:06:40.042 --> 01:06:43.042
Such testimonies are abundant.

104
01:06:43.042 --> 01:06:46.042
For do you know why? It is a different way of thinking.

105
01:06:46.042 --> 01:06:53.042
We need to step out of the way of thinking of society and step into the way of thinking of God.

106
01:06:53.042 --> 01:06:58.042
And trust in Him and know, He takes care of me.

107
01:06:58.042 --> 01:07:04.042
And with that challenge, I want to say, give and try it out.

108
01:07:05.042 --> 01:07:07.042
Try it out.

109
01:07:07.042 --> 01:07:11.042
And trust in Him, for He will never leave you.

110
01:07:19.042 --> 01:07:21.042
Ben, thank you all.

111
01:07:22.042 --> 01:07:23.042
Great.

112
01:07:26.042 --> 01:07:28.042
What Debbie says is true, you know.

113
01:07:29.042 --> 01:07:34.042
I was chatting with a friend of mine this week.

114
01:07:34.042 --> 01:07:38.042
He lives in Australia, he is a friend I still know from Australia.

115
01:07:38.042 --> 01:07:41.042
We chat regularly, Debbie.

116
01:07:41.042 --> 01:07:44.042
And Ian told me that they had been to the bank.

117
01:07:44.042 --> 01:07:49.042
They have a few apartments that they rent out and they invest their finances in God's kingdom.

118
01:07:49.042 --> 01:07:51.042
Those people live for God.

119
01:07:52.042 --> 01:07:58.042
And Ian went to the bank for the next apartment they were going to buy.

120
01:07:58.042 --> 01:08:01.042
And the bank said, yes but here $30,000 is missing.

121
01:08:01.042 --> 01:08:03.042
So we are not going to do it.

122
01:08:03.042 --> 01:08:05.042
And they went home.

123
01:08:05.042 --> 01:08:06.042
They had prayed for it.

124
01:08:06.042 --> 01:08:09.042
And they are always busy with God.

125
01:08:09.042 --> 01:08:12.042
And that same week, unannounced.

126
01:08:12.042 --> 01:08:13.042
That is really bizarre.

127
01:08:13.042 --> 01:08:17.042
Unannounced, that same week they received a letter from the government.

128
01:08:17.042 --> 01:08:22.042
In which the government admitted about the scandal that the Netherlands also experienced.

129
01:08:22.042 --> 01:08:25.042
For example, with the child benefit.

130
01:08:25.042 --> 01:08:29.042
Ian and his wife had also experienced that in Australia.

131
01:08:29.042 --> 01:08:33.042
And unannounced, without them knowing, the government said.

132
01:08:33.042 --> 01:08:35.042
We want to offer our apologies.

133
01:08:35.042 --> 01:08:38.042
Because we did not provide you with a whole lot of funding.

134
01:08:38.042 --> 01:08:41.042
And they received 30,000 dollars.

135
01:08:42.042 --> 01:08:44.042
30,000 dollars.

136
01:08:45.042 --> 01:08:49.042
Ian said, I had no idea I was entitled to that.

137
01:08:49.042 --> 01:08:51.042
Otherwise, I would have certainly made a big deal out of it.

138
01:08:51.042 --> 01:08:53.042
And that is God.

139
01:08:53.042 --> 01:08:58.042
And you know, in that way God is not a trick box.

140
01:08:58.042 --> 01:09:01.042
God is a person for whom you live.

141
01:09:01.042 --> 01:09:04.042
You live for the king.

142
01:09:04.042 --> 01:09:06.042
And the king provides.

143
01:09:06.042 --> 01:09:12.042
And when miracles come, we do not believe in a miracle god.

144
01:09:12.042 --> 01:09:15.042
Like a kind of miracles. He must perform miracles.

145
01:09:15.042 --> 01:09:23.042
I do not divide my life in such a way that I want to walk like little thumb from crumb to crumb from miracle to miracle.

146
01:09:23.042 --> 01:09:26.042
I just want to be a friend of Jesus.

147
01:09:26.042 --> 01:09:30.042
And let him make the miracles and signs evident through my life.

148
01:09:30.042 --> 01:09:35.042
But just live with a desire for King Jesus, people. Amen.

149
01:09:38.042 --> 01:09:40.042
Okay, here we go.

150
01:09:40.042 --> 01:09:42.042
I am excited.

151
01:09:42.042 --> 01:09:46.042
God is a wonderful God.

152
01:09:46.042 --> 01:09:49.042
And he is a loving Father.

153
01:09:49.042 --> 01:09:53.042
When I see situations happening in my family.

154
01:09:53.042 --> 01:09:56.042
And I have the responsibility over my family.

155
01:09:56.042 --> 01:10:01.042
And I would see things happening in the lives of my children.

156
01:10:01.042 --> 01:10:08.042
Then it is out of my love that I say, this must change.

157
01:10:08.042 --> 01:10:16.042
And that you bring restoration in the life of a child from his father.

158
01:10:16.042 --> 01:10:20.042
In the same way, we must look at God the Father.

159
01:10:20.042 --> 01:10:22.042
He is a loving Father.

160
01:10:22.042 --> 01:10:30.042
He wants, church, that you have a nice and happy life.

161
01:10:30.042 --> 01:10:34.042
You must remember that combination of words well.

162
01:10:34.042 --> 01:10:36.042
He wants you to be happy.

163
01:10:36.042 --> 01:10:38.042
He wants you to live.

164
01:10:38.042 --> 01:10:42.042
He does not want you to reign under the banner of death, to live.

165
01:10:42.042 --> 01:10:45.042
But that you live and that you reign.

166
01:10:45.042 --> 01:10:48.042
And that you have authority in life.

167
01:10:48.042 --> 01:10:53.042
And so when God speaks to us as a church.

168
01:10:53.042 --> 01:10:59.042
And he says, church, I want you to go through a process of cleansing.

169
01:10:59.042 --> 01:11:03.042
He says this because he is loving.

170
01:11:03.042 --> 01:11:08.042
He says this because he can see further ahead.

171
01:11:08.042 --> 01:11:14.042
He sees in advance, church, this is what you need to work on.

172
01:11:14.042 --> 01:11:19.042
For if you continue with this, then the end result will not be good.

173
01:11:19.042 --> 01:11:23.042
That is why God gives warnings in time.

174
01:11:23.042 --> 01:11:29.042
The Bible shows in many points that God also in your individual life,

175
01:11:29.042 --> 01:11:33.042
always initially when you listen to the Holy Spirit,

176
01:11:33.042 --> 01:11:38.042
then the Holy Spirit comes to you and then he says in my case,

177
01:11:38.042 --> 01:11:44.042
always first on an individual level so as not to shame you before anyone.

178
01:11:44.042 --> 01:11:48.042
It is entirely the work of the Holy Spirit not to make someone look foolish.

179
01:11:48.042 --> 01:11:52.042
Making someone look foolish does not belong in God's vocabulary.

180
01:11:52.042 --> 01:11:54.042
He does not do that.

181
01:11:54.042 --> 01:12:04.042
So whenever there is something that God wants to cleanse me of, He always comes to me first.

182
01:12:04.042 --> 01:12:09.042
However, I do not listen very well.

183
01:12:09.042 --> 01:12:11.042
Neither do you.

184
01:12:11.042 --> 01:12:14.042
But I will just speak for myself now.

185
01:12:14.042 --> 01:12:16.042
I do not listen very well.

186
01:12:16.042 --> 01:12:22.042
I believe that God is continuously speaking to me with His love.

187
01:12:22.042 --> 01:12:29.042
There are revelations and love and presence everywhere.

188
01:12:29.042 --> 01:12:31.042
It is omnipresent.

189
01:12:31.042 --> 01:12:35.042
We believe in an omnipresent God.

190
01:12:35.042 --> 01:12:37.042
He is everywhere.

191
01:12:37.042 --> 01:12:39.042
He has always been.

192
01:12:39.042 --> 01:12:41.042
He can always be.

193
01:12:41.042 --> 01:12:43.042
This is our God.

194
01:12:43.042 --> 01:12:44.042
He can do everything.

195
01:12:44.042 --> 01:12:45.042
He has everything.

196
01:12:45.042 --> 01:12:48.042
God is everything.

197
01:12:48.042 --> 01:12:52.042
God does not hide behind a tree.

198
01:12:52.042 --> 01:12:55.042
Nor does God stay in this building.

199
01:12:55.042 --> 01:13:00.042
When you go home later, it is not that God says I will see you again next week.

200
01:13:00.042 --> 01:13:02.042
Or I will see you again tomorrow here in this building.

201
01:13:02.042 --> 01:13:04.042
And only here am I.

202
01:13:04.042 --> 01:13:06.042
God goes with you.

203
01:13:06.042 --> 01:13:08.042
But we don't hear Him very well.

204
01:13:08.042 --> 01:13:10.042
Because we are often occupied.

205
01:13:10.042 --> 01:13:12.042
We are often busy.

206
01:13:12.042 --> 01:13:14.042
Hopefully not possessed.

207
01:13:14.042 --> 01:13:16.042
But we are often busy.

208
01:13:16.042 --> 01:13:19.042
With all kinds of busyness in our lives.

209
01:13:19.042 --> 01:13:21.042
And we are so busy.

210
01:13:21.042 --> 01:13:23.042
Exactly what Debbie just said.

211
01:13:23.042 --> 01:13:26.042
In the collection education.

212
01:13:26.042 --> 01:13:28.042
We are often so busy.

213
01:13:28.042 --> 01:13:32.042
That we have so much focus on that one thing.

214
01:13:32.042 --> 01:13:34.042
And now we are busy with that.

215
01:13:34.042 --> 01:13:36.042
And it's not at all bad that you are busy with that.

216
01:13:36.042 --> 01:13:38.042
As long as you do it with Jesus.

217
01:13:38.042 --> 01:13:42.042
So that He can guide you when you are busy with that.

218
01:13:42.042 --> 01:13:43.042
Raising your children.

219
01:13:43.042 --> 01:13:45.042
Renovating your house.

220
01:13:45.042 --> 01:13:47.042
Doing something with your career.

221
01:13:47.042 --> 01:13:49.042
Searching for a partner in your life.

222
01:13:49.042 --> 01:13:52.042
You can do all things together with Jesus.

223
01:13:52.042 --> 01:13:55.042
And that Jesus can speak to you.

224
01:13:55.042 --> 01:13:58.042
And that he can guide you in what you do.

225
01:13:58.042 --> 01:14:00.042
That is what he wants.

226
01:14:00.042 --> 01:14:07.042
He wants to have an intimate, detailed relationship with you.

227
01:14:07.042 --> 01:14:11.042
God is not only the God of the big picture.

228
01:14:11.042 --> 01:14:14.042
He is also concerned with the small details.

229
01:14:14.042 --> 01:14:18.042
He wants to talk with you about everything.

230
01:14:18.042 --> 01:14:21.042
About the color you paint your wall.

231
01:14:21.042 --> 01:14:23.042
I don't care.

232
01:14:23.042 --> 01:14:29.042
But you can discuss everything, everything, everything with him.

233
01:14:29.042 --> 01:14:37.042
I am proud and happy like a father.

234
01:14:37.042 --> 01:14:40.042
When my son comes to me.

235
01:14:40.042 --> 01:14:45.042
And tells me something about what he experienced at school.

236
01:14:45.042 --> 01:14:48.042
Even if I don't care at all.

237
01:14:48.042 --> 01:14:51.042
What happened in the sandbox.

238
01:14:51.042 --> 01:14:54.042
But because he comes to me.

239
01:14:54.042 --> 01:14:58.042
And wants to share something and converse with me.

240
01:14:58.042 --> 01:15:00.042
I am with him.

241
01:15:00.042 --> 01:15:03.042
I love my kid.

242
01:15:03.042 --> 01:15:08.042
On the sidelines of the soccer field, I am his biggest fan.

243
01:15:09.042 --> 01:15:13.042
Really, I am a hooligan for Joshua.

244
01:15:13.042 --> 01:15:15.042
But I mean it seriously.

245
01:15:15.042 --> 01:15:20.042
I am so intense, intimate with Joshua and Olivia.

246
01:15:20.042 --> 01:15:25.042
And God wants to be that intense and intimate with you.

247
01:15:25.042 --> 01:15:28.042
He does not want to stand on the sidelines.

248
01:15:28.042 --> 01:15:30.042
He is on the field with you.

249
01:15:30.042 --> 01:15:32.042
He is your supporter.

250
01:15:32.042 --> 01:15:34.042
He gives the assist.

251
01:15:34.042 --> 01:15:35.042
You just have to score it.

252
01:15:35.042 --> 01:15:37.042
He is amazing.

253
01:15:37.042 --> 01:15:40.042
I just want to set a frame at the beginning of this sermon.

254
01:15:40.042 --> 01:15:43.042
That God is good.

255
01:15:43.042 --> 01:15:45.042
He is good.

